                  <photoshop:LayerName>Save the ocean is a cooperative worker placement game which  de</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Save the ocean is a cooperative worker placement game which  depicts the real life marine ecosystem disaster caused by  pollution. The game simulates some of the crucial approaches        and policies that we can adopt in reality to cope with such  .disaster </photoshop:LayerText>
