               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>  It is a heartwarming game of recycling and conservation that </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>  It is a heartwarming game of recycling and conservation that will  stay with the gamer for a lifetime as they learn the most  fundamental environmental aspects about reducing , reusing,  .and recyclin </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Player takes on the roles of the Ocean defender By cleaning up </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Player takes on the roles of the Ocean defender By cleaning up  the massive amount of garbage, conducting researches and  developing eco-skills, the playerâ€™s mission is to stop the entrance    of huge   </photoshop:LayerText>
