            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>9</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>9</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Making first impression with combination of using the Chance an</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Making first impression with combination of using the Chance and  .educational aspects    Sharpen the playerâ€™s focus  The player can't blame her|himself because the dice can roll either  .way </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>The gamer (our hero actually) will unbox the Box to discover it</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The gamer (our hero actually) will unbox the Box to discover it .contents and objects He/she will face with a board , dice , 2 Vertebrae and a sphero Robo and also There is a small real shell with QR code in, so when the player scan it with cellphone will hear the voice of Crab in that asks .for help to rescue them </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>In The beginning, The garbages are moving from the starting poi</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>In The beginning, The garbages are moving from the starting point .in the sea or ocean to continue their way in the marine area We canâ€™t stop producing the garbages, so the way to resolve the .problem is to start recycling them :So the First stage of the game will start like this: Our Sphero Robo should be put in the first Vertebrae Of the board And the indicator of the garbages  .will be in the first Vertebrae in the left For starting the game itâ€™s necessary to roll the dice at first to show us that for how many Vertebraes the Robo will move on the 18 blocks of the game  board, But before that What is needed to permit the player to start the game . is movement of the garbage Vertebrae,forward for one block  </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>.1</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>.1</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>.2</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>.2</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>.3</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>.3</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
