                  <photoshop:LayerName>The antagonist of the story that is garbage are considered to b</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The antagonist of the story that is garbage are considered to be alive and their goal is to occupy all the ocean. they will try their best to force the animals to leave the ocean, therefore the playerâ€™s mission is to save the .ocean and prevent the garbages to enter the ocean    So The number given from the dice, will show where the player will be lead to , In which block Due to the block the player would be in, he or she encounters with 3 kinds .of materials to do the mission as been said above    Clips Questions The stories </photoshop:LayerText>
