                  <photoshop:LayerText>The player will roll the dice for the second time and if that block was dedicated to the video part, Thereâ€™s is a QR code that leads the player  to an educational video link that the player should watch that to be able to continue the game ( usually in the YouTube, 7 to 8 minutes ) It may be the funniest and most likable part of the game for the player When the player finished watching the video, a coin will be given to the player as the reward , And the garbages would not be moved .anymore After doing the {education} task, watching the video   Or if that block was dedicated to the story part, Thereâ€™s is a QR code that leads the player to an educational story link that should be read .that to be able to continue the game</photoshop:LayerText>
