         <photoshop:TextLayers>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>The protagonist of the story in the gamer who is in the role of</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The protagonist of the story in the gamer who is in the role of ocean saver, will learn a lot through doing some different activities like watching related videos, answering simple but fundamental questions about the specific important issues .we (as the game designer) involving with to teach them </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>When the player finished having 10 coins by doing different act</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>When the player finished having 10 coins by doing different activities like for example watching 3 videos, answering 3 questions and reading 4 stories, will be able to get a Badge that will make the player become the leader or someone like a lord commander and gets the permission to construct a refinery house to stop the garbages for ever , And then the player will be .the .winner of the game      </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
